        "python": {
          "lang": "python",
          "equivalence": "identical",
          "code": "def add_tag(tags: list):\n    tags.append(\"new\")        # 改内容：调用方看得到\n    tags = [\"replaced\"]       # ⚠ 改绑定：只在函数内生效，调用方不受影响\n\nxs = []\nadd_tag(xs)                   # xs == [\"new\"]\n\nn = 1\ndef bump(v):\n    v += 1                    # int 不可变，调用方永远看不到变化\nbump(n)                       # n 仍然是 1",
          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> add_tag</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">tags</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">:</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> list</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    tags</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">append</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"new\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        # 改内容：调用方看得到</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    tags </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> [</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"replaced\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">]       </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># ⚠ 改绑定：只在函数内生效，调用方不受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">xs </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">add_tag</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(xs)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                   # xs == [\"new\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">n </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> bump</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">v</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    v </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">+=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                    # int 不可变，调用方永远看不到变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">bump</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(n)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                       # n 仍然是 1</span></span></code></pre>",
